# Protected internal material with no build-time or runtime use.
#
# The placement item bank's source markdown carries answer keys and listening
# transcripts. The generated `.server.ts` modules necessarily ship (the server
# scores from them), but the raw book is only ever read by
# `npm run placement:port`, which is a manual developer step — so there is no
# reason for it to be on a deployment at all.
scripts/placement/source-item-bank.md
